5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m glad we’re finally addressing this. The current split feels arbitrary, and I’d like to understand the actual usage patterns before we commit to anything.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about who actually does the math every month. It’s become a huge time sink for whoever ends up with it.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The old method was for three people. We need to see if the current split still matches how we actually use the space.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the full year’s data before agreeing to any new structure. I’m anxious about hidden costs or sudden spikes.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to be nice to each other. The money talk makes everyone feel a bit sad and distant.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the sentiment, Minato, but feelings won’t balance the ledger. We need hard numbers to prevent that distance from growing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
